            <ArticleTitle>[Double-blind randomized clinical study of a droperidol-fentanyl combination].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>225-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Droperidol 1:50 given with Fentanyl increases the analgetic action of the latter by one third. This effect is not enhanced by increasing the dosage of droperidol.</AbstractText>
